+"""Verified problem generator for arXiv:1105.2672.
+
+The generated task is native to the paper: find a strict coloring of a
+3-uniform bi-hypergraph.  A coloring is represented compactly by a homogeneous
+linear polynomial over GF(p).  Instances are affine relabelings of random
+partial sub-hypergraphs of H*_{q,q} from Section 3.  The planted coordinate
+projection is carried through the relabeling, never recovered by solving.
